# Repo scope

RideWise is one git repo with three sibling apps. Default work is **`mobile-app/`**.

- Do not create, edit, delete, or run installs in **`api/`** or **`landing/`** until the user explicitly commands work on those folders.
- Do not “helpfully” scaffold, restyle, or wire the API or landing page as a side effect of a mobile task.
- Load `.cursor/skills/ridewise-mobile/SKILL.md` when changing the Expo app.
- Follow approval-gated milestones: finish one mobile feature, then wait.
